'''Immeasurable Power''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Truth's Devouring Maw]]. [[Sage of Logic Newtone]] is introduced here and can be unlocked as a [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] at a 30% chance when beating the stage (guaranteed if a Treasure Radar is used). This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

