==Trivia==
*Based on its Japanese name, Immeasurable Power may have been intended as a reference to [[wikipedia:Newton's laws of motion|Newton's laws of motion]], which revolve around force, or Newton's eponymous SI unit for measuring force, the [[wikipedia:Newton (unit)|newton]]. 力 was officially translated as "Power", but can also mean "force".
*The whirlpool that represents Immeasurable Power can be seen earlier when viewing [[Permission to Land]], the first [[Zero Legends]] stage to take place in a [[Media:Map042.png|rearranged North and South America]].
*Immeasurable Power appears to have been designed specifically for [[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultimate Thundia β]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] alongside [[Truth's Devouring Maw]]. Ultimate Thundia β deals massive damage to [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], is immune to both Newtone's slow and Mr. Angel's weaken, and has a [[Talents|Talent]] that reduces damage she takes from Newtone's [[Mini-Wave]]s.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]] had a 3% drop chance from this stage.

